<title>USA: NY electronics retailer 47th St. Photo closes - NYT.</title>
<headline>NY electronics retailer 47th St. Photo closes - NYT.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>New York electronics retailer 47th Street Photo has shut, laid off its workforce and might not reopen, the New York Times said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The company, a New York retailing landmark during the past 30 years, said it was reevaluating its position, the paper said. It decided to close for a number of reasons, including uncertainty over whether it would be able to continue using its name, the paper said.</p>
<p>((New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
